WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:07.230
Know then... that beyond the charted stars, there is a universe called Veydrift.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:19.250
Here, nothing is hidden. Every build... every fleet... every battle... is written into the chain itself.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:31.450
Three resources rule this universe. Metal... to build. Crystal... to know. Deuterium... to move.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.250
Whoever masters all three... masters the drift.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:43.150
From the shipyards rise sixteen classes of ship... and one, feared above all.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.110
The Dreadstar.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:56.630
Ninety-four thousand fleets have crossed the dark. Seventeen thousand battles... have been fought.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:04.330
Each one decided by fate... sealed on-chain... and open for all to see.

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.890
Not one ship lost.

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:12.250
Great houses have risen... and the throne is still contested.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:22.110
Once the token launches... what you mine can pass through the Rift, as real tokens, traded onchain.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:26.250
And tokens flow back in... as resources.

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:32.310
Entry is instant. Exits wait twenty-eight days... in plain sight.

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:35.910
To take value out... you must defend it.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:43.130
Binding it all together... the Veydrift token. One billion... and never one more.

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:49.450
Proposed launch: a PACT... a clearing auction... then public liquidity.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:52.450
Your planet is waiting, Commander.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.690
veydrift.com
